    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1St Pc Game In 1958:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed perspective 3D unlimited points mini-game, just control the platform to move left and right to bounce the ball and cross the center line to get points, and the highest points will be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no point cap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The ball falls to the ground, and the points are cleared and restarted, but the highest points will be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS:\u00a0Someone makes the first interactive game on a computer.Hats off to some one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the movement speed of the platform, as long as the ball does not fall, you will have a chance to get more points. As much as possible, do not move the platform outside the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1St Pc Game In 1958:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed perspective 3D unlimited points mini-game, just control the platform to move left and right to bounce the ball and cross the center line to get points, and the highest points will be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no point cap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The ball falls to the ground, and the points are cleared and restarted, but the highest points will be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS:\u00a0Someone makes the first interactive game on a computer.Hats off to some one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the movement speed of the platform, as long as the ball does not fall, you will have a chance to get more points. As much as possible, do not move the platform outside the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
